%p
  %em Future Standard
  is not a real format you can play. It's a preview of what
  = succeed "," do
    = link_to "Standard", "/format/standard"
  is going to look like after the next rotation, so it drops the sets which are about to rotate out, and it includes sets which aren't released yet.

%p
  Ban list is just current Standard ban list, as nobody knows yet what is going to be banned after the rotation.

%p
  For official rotation schedule, check <a href="http://whatsinstandard.com/">what's in Standard</a> site.

%ul
  = search_help "f:future", "cards which will be in Standard after the next rotation"
  = search_help "f:standard -f:future", "cards rotating out of Standard at the next rotation"
  = search_help "f:future -f:standard", "cards which will join Standard at the next rotation"
